Sinnoh_EternaCity_Text_Person4:
	.string "This is TEAM GALACTIC's building. No\n"
	.string "visitors allowed!$"

Sinnoh_EternaCity_Text_Person5:
	.string "The BOSS is very busy. Very, very busy.\n"
	.string "Go away!$"

Sinnoh_EternaCity_Text_Person13:
	.string "CYNTHIA: That statue is said to show a\n"
	.string "POKéMON of time. I study old legends\l"
	.string "like it.\p"
	.string "Sometimes I wonder what the people\n"
	.string "who made it were afraid of.$"

Sinnoh_EternaCity_Text_Person24:
	.string "Our ETERNA building is very important.\n"
	.string "Like a moon base. On the ground.$"

Sinnoh_EternaCity_Text_Person31:
	.string "There's a big bug in the forest that\n"
	.string "only comes out at night. I'm going to\l"
	.string "find it!$"

Sinnoh_EternaCity_Text_Person32:
	.string "GARDENIA: The GYM's waiting for you!\n"
	.string "My grass POKéMON have been restless\l"
	.string "all day.$"

Sinnoh_EternaCity_Text_Person33:
	.string "CYRUS: The statue shows time itself.\n"
	.string "Time keeps moving whether we wish it\l"
	.string "to or not.\p"
	.string "I would rather the world began again.\n"
	.string "Without the parts that hurt.$"

Sinnoh_EternaCity_Text_Person34:
	.string "BARRY: ETERNA's got a statue that's\n"
	.string "like a million years old! I raced here\l"
	.string "to see it. Now I'm racing to the GYM.\l"
	.string "Bye!$"

@ --- end of SINNOH words ---
